Screen:

The first two selections are the number of pixels for
the width and height respectfully. Usually 640 * 200
or 640 * 400 are used. The number of colours is easily
selected by just clicking on the numbered gadget to 
cycle through the possible colour combinations.

If you wish TERM to run on the WB, then just select 
'YES' and accept. If you wish to change it back to
opening up TERM on a custom screen, then you only need
to select 'NO'.

Once you are satisfied with your choices, you may
select ACCEPT to save your configuration as a new
person to the VBBS environment. If at any time you wish
to exit what you are doing, just select CANCEL.
